text.en:
2. Subsection 1(1) of Part I of the Tenth Schedule to the Federal

Constitution is amended by substituting for paragraphs (a), (b), (c)

and (d) the following paragraphs:

"(a) for the first 100,000 persons at the rate of RM102.00

per person;

(b) for the next 500,000 persons at the rate of RM14.00

per person;

(c) for the next 500,000 persons at the rate of RM13.50

per person;

(d) for the remainder at the rate of RM13.00 per person,".
